/* atuipm.rc -- resources for the PM build, appended to the image by
   `build.cmd pmexe`.  Not decoration: a Watcom system os2v2_pm image has
   no resource segment at all until rc appends one, and WinCreateStdWindow
   then fails PMERR_RESOURCE_NOT_FOUND (TESTING.md, "PM probe: green").

   Only the icon is here.  The id is the one the frame is created with --
   256, the stdwnd sample's ID_WINDOW, written as a number so RC needs no
   header and no -i path on this box.  The probe's MENU and ACCELTABLE are
   deliberately not repeated: atui draws its own menu bar inside the
   window, and a second one in the frame would only compete with it.

   The icon is the probe's for now; an atui-drawn one is later polish. */
ICON    256 atui.ico
